# Web3Forms access key for form submissions (Contact + Newsletter)
# Get a key free at https://web3forms.com — enter info@praxisinitiative.org,
# click "Get Access Key", and paste it below.
#
# This must ALSO be set in the Vercel project (Settings -> Environment Variables,
# Production) before the build runs. Vite inlines it at build time, so adding it
# after a deploy requires a redeploy.
#
# If it is missing from a production build, the Web3Forms request is stripped
# from the bundle and the Contact/Newsletter forms cannot deliver submissions.
# `npm run build` warns when it is unset.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
